    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Estate Agents are delighted to present this superb one bedroom ground floor apartment with its own front door to the North Dublin property market. Ideally located within the highly sought after and mature Holywell development, this attractive apartment offers spacious well maintained accommodation in a convenient and well connected setting close to Swords and Dublin Airport.\n\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, the accommodation comprises a bright entrance hallway, spacious open plan living/ dining area, a fully fitted kitchen, a generous double bedroom, and a well appointed bathroom.\n\nAdditional features include gas fired central heating, an impressive BER C rating, designated parking, and access to a professionally managed development with competitive management fees.\n\nHolywell is a popular residential location offering an excellent range of amenities, including shops, cafés, leisure facilities, and excellent transport links. Swords Main Street, The Pavilions Shopping Centre, Airside Retail Park, and Dublin Airport are all within easy reach. The area is well served by public transport, with the Swords Express bus stop just a short stroll away, while the nearby M1 and M50 motorways provide convenient access to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\n\nThis property presents an ideal opportunity for first time buyers, investors, or those seeking a comfortable and low-maintenance home in a thriving and highly accessible location.\n\nViewing highly recommended!\n\nContact DNG Estate Agents in Phibsboro.\nLocal DNG agents: Isabel O'Neill, Brian McGee, Vincent Mullen, Leah Barry, Michelle Keeley & Ciaran Jones MIPAV"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - \nThe smart entrance hallway comes with a tiled floor and painted décor, creating a stylish and welcoming entrance to the home.\n\nLiving Room/Dining area - 1.58m x 3.31m\nThe inviting living room/ dining area features laminate wood flooring and painted décor, creating a warm and comfortable living space. A decorative fireplace surround with a gas insert serves as an elegant focal point, adding both character and warmth to the room.\n\nKitchen - 2.38m x 2.17m\nThe kitchen features stylish modern white fitted units, splashback tiling, contemporary appliances, and laminate wood flooring.\n\nBedroom - 3.17m x 3.31m\nSituated to the rear of the property, this spacious double bedroom features laminate wood flooring, painted décor, built in fitted wardrobes, and French doors leading to a private balcony\n\nBathroom - 2.15m x 1.64m\nThe family bathroom comprises laminate wood flooring, a wc, wash hand basin and a bath with telephone style shower attachment. The walls are partially tiled.\n\nBalcony - 1.48m x 3.51m\nBedroom with direct access to a private balcony overlooking mature trees, offering a private and tranquil setting.\n\nOutside front - \nThe apartment benefits from its own private front door and is set within beautifully landscaped communal gardens. Residents enjoy access to a children's playground, designated parking, and conveniently located communal bin sheds.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Management fee 800 per annum</li><li> Spacious 1 bed apartment with own front door.</li><li> Spacious balcony off the bedroom</li><li> Double glazed upvc windows</li><li> Gas fire radiator central heating</li><li> Modern internal decor.</li><li> Quality built in wardrobes</li><li> Well maintained communal gardens</li><li> Walking distance to bus routes including the Swords Express</li><li> Easy access to City Centre, Dublin Airport, M1/M50 intersection</li><li> Adjacent good schools, new Tesco S.C, local shops and sports facilities</li><li> Close to Pavilions S.C, Airside Retail Park & Swords Town Centre</ul>"
      },
      {
